7. Phase 2: Comparative execution study

The comparative study will use identical task requirements across architectures.

7.1 Comparison matrix (revised)

Candidate Primary question Main risks
HPSC-class RISC-V reference Is the mission-relevant baseline already sufficient? Fixed performance ceiling; availability of qualification evidence
Optimized laboratory CPU What does a well-optimized terrestrial implementation achieve? Not mission-relevant; misleading as a baseline
CPU + GPU Does parallel execution improve useful performance? Transfers, power, interference, isolation cost
