Implication for MARS-AI-COMPUTE: This is the strongest FPGA energy result in the reviewed set, but it concerns a control workload (Class A/B in Section 8.1), not perception. It is relevant to R1/R3 motion control but not directly to W1. It also compares against embedded GPU, not HPSC.

