   Isolation: [spatial / access / priority / other]

   NOMINAL (isolation disabled)
   +---------------------------------------------------+
   | [========= T_nominal = 120 ms =========]          |
   +---------------------------------------------------+

   ISOLATED (mechanism enabled)
   +---------------------------------------------------+
   | [========= T_nominal =========]                   |
   | [==== P_isolation =====]                          |
   | [============ T_isolated = 200 ms ============]   |
   +---------------------------------------------------+

