   +---------------------------------------------------+
   | Speedup vs HPSC: 3.0x  ->  effective 1.8x         |
   | If effective benefit < minimum meaningful:        |
   |     REJECT for this workload                      |
   +---------------------------------------------------+

   NOTE: A candidate that is fast only when its
         timing is untrustworthy is NOT FAST for a
