   |     +-- Memory corruption (multi-bit)
   |            detect: checksum + temporal consistency
   |            latency: <=1 frame
   |            fallback: reject + safe stop
   |
   +-- SILENT DATA CORRUPTION
   |     +-- Plausible-but-wrong mask
   |            detect: independent CPU stereo cross-check
   |            latency: <=1 frame
   |            fallback: cross-validate before motion
   |            residual: shared sensor or shared model
   |
   +-- ENVIRONMENTAL / SYSTEM FAULTS
   |     +-- Thermal throttle
   |     |      detect: thermal sensor + perf counter
   |     |      latency: seconds
   |     |      fallback: reduce rate, degrade resolution
   |     |      residual: silent if not logged
   |     +-- Watchdog failure
   |     |      detect: second independent watchdog
   |     |      latency: <=200 ms
   |     |      fallback: hardware safe-stop
   |     +-- Voting mechanism failure
   |            detect: voter self-test + periodic known-input test
   |            latency: <=1 mission cycle
   |            fallback: fall back to Class 1, reduce autonomy
   |
   +-- SHARED FAULTS (hidden risk)
